		Tooltip:
			'''
			Post-Plantera
			Hold left-click for 1.5 seconds; the two sights converge at full charge. Release to fire.
			Charge increases damage, shot size and knockback; horizontal mobility falls to 12%.
			Consumes one bullet on release, converting it to a unique shot.
			'''
	}

	FartoothGreatbow: {
		DisplayName: Fartooth's Feathershine Greatbow
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Lunar events
			Hold left-click for 1.5 seconds; the two sights converge at full charge. Release to fire.
